      "uid": "zhcn:2a259a5cc1e530b0f8861131",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天，目白多伯将要参加一场模拟赛。\r\n身为队伍的副训练员，我与首席训练员一起坐在观众席上观战。\r\n然而——",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0532b91732388126853a30c660803d3b20a95c6290b62134e5aacbcfb6d3463",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
